#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_precompiledPreambleStorage)
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: shell/settings/languagepreferences.ui:421
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Store precompiled preambles in:"
msgstr "Almacenar os preámbulos compilados previamente en:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, kcfg_precompiledPreambleStorage)
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: shell/settings/languagepreferences.ui:436
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Precompiled preambles remain in the temporary directory after KDevelop crashes and are deleted only when the same session is started again.<br>"
"\n"
"When the preambles are stored in memory, they are guaranteed to disappear on exit even if KDevelop crashes.<br>"
"\n"
"Choosing the Session Temporary Directory storage makes sense on systems where RAM is limited and the temporary directory does not use tmpfs, because the preamble files can occupy gigabytes of space.<br>"
"\n"
"Changing this option takes effect after restarting KDevelop.<br>"
"\n"
"This option has effect only if KDevelop has been built against Clang version 17 or later.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Os preámbulos compilados previamente mantéñense no cartafol temporal cando KDevelop quebra e elimínanse só cando se volve iniciar a mesma sesión de novo.<br>"
"\n"
"Cando os preámbulos se almacenan en memoria, desaparecerán ao saír aínda que KDevelop quebre.<br>"
"\n"
"Escoller o almacenamento de cartafol temporal de sesión ten sentido en sistemas nos que a RAM é limitada e o cartafol temporal non usa «tmpfs», porque os ficheiros de preámbulo pode ocupar gigabytes de espazo.<br>"
"\n"
"Cambiar esta opción xurde efecto tras reiniciar KDevelop.<br>"
"\n"
"Esta opción só xurde efecto se KDevelop se construíu coa versión 17 ou superior de Clang.\n"
"</p>"

